Blockwright is an editor for ANSI art in CP437 block characters and for
IRC colour art. It has half-block, shade and form brushes, layers, text
faces and styles, a library of stamps, and generator layers that run
scripts.

It reads and writes .ans with SAUCE, XBIN and BIN, exports IRC text within
a line budget and checks a piece against lint rules. The blockwright-cli
command renders, converts and checks pieces without a display.
